## Usage

Run the job from the project root:

```bash
uv run poe run
```

This is the same as running `{{ project.repository_name }}` or
`python -m {{ project.package_name }}` directly. The job reads
`data/sample_input.json`, transforms each record, and writes
`data/output.json`.

## Project structure

```text
src/{{ project.package_name }}/   Package source, including the job
tests/                            Test suite
data/sample_input.json            Tracked sample input
data/output.json                  Job output -- regenerated on every run, git-ignored
```

Rerunning the job is always safe: it is a deterministic, idempotent
transformation of the tracked input, and output is written atomically. A
malformed input record makes the job exit non-zero and log the failure
without writing partial output. Edit `src/{{ project.package_name }}/job.py`
to change the transformation.
